+# Patches of this source line that a board of it must not apply, with the reason.
+
+pgz-aligned-validation: XNU 8796 has no page-guard zones; zone_id_require_aligned does not exist
+public-entitlements-header: the 8796 necp client includes CodeSignature/Entitlements.h, not CoreEntitlements
+published-freezer-condition: the 8796 freezer has no FREEZE_ENABLED_DEFAULT flag to repair
+offline-owner-systemos-mount: the owner chain, cryptex policy and its kern_exec hooks are 10063 only
+zzy-native-gpu-addon-mount: builds on the owner Data mount this line does not have
+zzy-staged-system-apps: builds on the owner Data mount this line does not have
+zzz-boot-progress: the 8796 console has no vc_progress hook and no sleh.c; the boot screen is a 10063 feature
